WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.640
The easiest way to 
think about it is this.

2
00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.560
You're not building value 
in one individual property.

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.280
You're building value 
across the Domoee property pool.

4
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.280
So as you make your monthly payments, 
you're growing your stake in that pool.

5
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.520
And as the value of the pool grows, 
the value you've built can grow too.

6
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.320
It's a different approach,
but the goal is the same.

7
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.160
You're building wealth while
having a place to call home.